  "runtimeLayoutNotes": "Interleaved-petals-v6 gives each mesh its own seated cup profile. Outer openings span 18-42 degrees, middle 36-66, inner 60-82, so neighboring families overlap. All membranes wrap around the blossom with nearly zero local roll. Outer rims curl gently outward. Seeded placement varies angular spacing and fine pose offsets. A small baked surface offset separates overlapping edges. Each mesh has two asymmetric UV maps. Per-petal neutral brightness and the three layer albedos are shared with the prior material revision. Petals and core share CrownMotion.",
